  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Evaluation SALA-IDA</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utv Sv Kommunf&#xf6;rbundet</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med uppdraget &#xe4;r att utv&#xe4;rdera de Sidafinansierade projekt avseende lokalt sj&#xe4;lvstyre som utf&#xf6;rts av Svenska Kommunf&#xf6;rbundet (SALA) mellan 1995-2000 i Kaliningrad, Karelen, Novgorod och Moskva. Utv&#xe4;rderingen skall &#xe4;ven kunna ge underlag f&#xf6;r Sidas st&#xe4;llningstagande till en eventuell forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; projekten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the evaluation is to acquire knowledge about the relevance, effects, impact, cost-effectiveness and sustainability of the Swedish support and to point out future development possibilities as well as lessons to be learned from projects carried out by SALA in Russia between the years 1995 and the present.</narrative>
  </description>
